Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.37,0:00:05.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}One number keeps the score:\Nthe {\c&H7AAF1B&}magnetic Reynolds number{\c&HF7F4F2&}, Rm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:11.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}It is the {\c&HE58739&}flow's speed{\c&HF7F4F2&}, times its size,\Ndivided by the magnetic diffusivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Large Rm: stretching outpaces smudging.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:18.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Small Rm: smudging wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Turn the Rm knob up,\Nand watch a weak seed field.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.17,0:00:27.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}At low Rm, the seed dies away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:33.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Past a threshold, the growth rate crosses\Nzero and the seed grows, like the squeal.
